Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Seventh Episode\NMagic Water\NHurry! Black Cloud Island
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was tricked by that Tink doll and thrown down a valley.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:03:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And there, that foul smoke blinded me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I returned to the castle, an impostor was in my place.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit back and wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I will expose this scheme!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And Father and Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice... Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I will finally take your boy's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless, useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know where your father and mother are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Father and Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... You kidnapped them, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.39,0:03:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak! Where are my parents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...if you come to my lair and trade your boy's heart for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:52.30,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Zuborasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:59.86,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Ishi no tsuru yo, waga yama de tobe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:59.86,Mephisto Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,O Stone crane, fly to my mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.77,0:04:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are my parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.75,0:04:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A promise is a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you. Those two are on Sea Serpent Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea Serpent Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They're staying quiet there without making a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They've both been turned to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With my full power, they've become stone that can't move a single hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Father and Mother... turned to stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Untie my ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to Sea Serpent Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.68,0:05:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. After I transfer your boy's heart to Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you hate taking the boy's heart so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My strength as Sapphire isn't enough to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto will be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:46.39,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,,Zubarasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, you must be hiding in one of these jars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.15,0:06:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good girl and come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, listen to your papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hecate, open the lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't send you away, so come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.81,0:06:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're hiding inside this jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get ready to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure the lid won't open, but Papa will come straight here as soon as he realizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa is begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.27,0:06:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even break the jar with magic while you're inside. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.08,0:07:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make it to where the ship is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.89,0:07:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could heal your eyes, but it's beyond my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just taking me to Sea Serpent Island is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we have to get to Sea Serpent Island before Papa comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.09,0:08:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa's probably furious right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I drift off?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness. I was worried we lost our way while I was asleep, but we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, have we reached Sea Serpent Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see my father and mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, look! Sea Serpent Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we've finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to the boat! Hold tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The island is surrounded by treacherous whirlpools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.95,0:08:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If we get caught in one, we're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That was rough, but we made it to Sea Serpent Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where are my parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They should be somewhere on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.64,0:09:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet. It's the sea serpents that lives on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If they spot us, we're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.01,0:10:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it pull you! Cut it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, above you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from there, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father and mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Where, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your mother, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This cold touch... is my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we break this spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:11:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,One way is for my father to undo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you because he won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And the other way is to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,pour all the blood of the person who loves them most over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Every last drop of my blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I love Father and Mother more than anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I cover them in my blood, the spell will break?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Mother, my blood will break this demon's curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.03,0:11:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die if you do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.49,0:11:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.74,0:11:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.06,0:12:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw this corpse into the sea to feed the fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.94,0:12:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have escaped from some island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to get involved in any trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.39,0:12:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw him into the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlucky bastard—just when he was almost saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.18,0:12:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.49,0:12:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Put him down, Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver, I won't let you give orders on my ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look into it. Put them in the war room!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.60,0:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Never thought I'd see you in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, get a good night's sleep first so you can recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.34,0:13:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So you don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the prisoner you saved a year ago when Grand Duke Duralumin captured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I'm a pirate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you even see my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're okay with me, won't you talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a pact with the Snow Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.22,0:14:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How sickening...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.28,0:14:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Word is her army will invade Silverland soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Mephisto and my imposter...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, most likely the Snow Queen's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.82,0:14:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that Snow Queen! Next time I see her, I won't let her get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.49,0:14:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, we need to cure your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Cure my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can my sight really be restored?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate sails to ports all over the world and hears all kinds of rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them is about the Waterfall of Purification.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Waterfall of Purification?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.26,0:14:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wash your eyes with the water from that waterfall,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,, it'll flush out the poison and restore your sight in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes... I'll be able to see again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting to Black Cloud Island where the waterfall is might be dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but with Blood around, you've got nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood's really gone soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Real deal or not, I'm not risking my neck for a guy like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:14:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't let yourself catch a chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that Blood. Just you wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it was dangerous...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right, there are two treacherous spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,One is the Raging Rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Cove of the Ancient Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Raging Rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cove of the Ancient Capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.89,0:15:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, drink this to warm yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.22,0:15:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want any!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't drink alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I put it in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because I saved you, why are you being so nice to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.38,0:15:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't go asking weird things out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This suits you much better than liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved it, hoping I'd run into you again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make a fool of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, no matter how much you act like a boy, I know you're a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you starting that again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.03,0:15:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you ever get the chance, just once would be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you wear it and show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking on water!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Repair the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.61,0:16:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The water stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The water stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.49,0:16:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Trim the sails! Hold fast! Rocks straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.48,0:16:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.52,0:16:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.18,0:17:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Raging Rocks...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the Raging Rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are we heading toward Black Cloud Island with the waterfall?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no matter what you say, I'm getting involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't dawdle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Water's rushing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.24,0:17:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hard to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bare to right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.19,0:17:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:17:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Some captain you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.11,0:18:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Sapphire all you can see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't pull yourself together, I fear for what lies ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.17,0:18:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Land ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The island's coming into view!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My head feels so fuzzy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting to me, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.19,0:19:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That song is the voice of a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.49,0:19:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, my head's going crazy too...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come back to my senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who wants to be shark bait, go right ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.97,0:19:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Blood has landed on Black Cloud Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.03,0:19:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No way am I moving a muscle for a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.23,0:19:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard... just wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.29,0:19:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, this is Black Cloud Island, home of the Waterfall of Purification.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver, you didn't need to bring that with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You never know what might show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood, I hear the sound of water over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.82,0:20:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be the Waterfall of Purification.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.62,0:20:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, the footing is treacherous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go stand over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:20:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wash thoroughly to rinse out the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.98,0:21:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.44,0:21:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like before!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.94,0:21:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Rinse them well!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the water soak into your eyes and wash them carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver, you dare turn against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting a long time for this chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.50,0:21:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then no one will get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.47,0:21:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes... I can see again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.22,0:21:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.45,0:21:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.11,0:22:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.17,0:22:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're facing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.15,0:22:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Impudent brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.32,0:22:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of you first!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.67,0:22:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.94,0:22:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.44,0:22:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,F-F-F-F-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.36,0:22:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.77,0:22:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.63,0:22:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:22:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.60,0:22:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,First, let me wash that wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.35,0:22:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.44,0:23:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as strong as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.14,0:23:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But I like you better in a dress, like yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that we should hurry back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm really glad you got your sight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you, Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.06,0:23:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.17,0:23:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care and stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.96,0:23:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.80,0:23:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.70,0:23:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.36,0:23:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.93,0:23:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:23:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.34,0:24:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll defeat the Snow Queen and protect Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Mother, please wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.78,0:24:30.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.42,0:24:33.78,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.42,0:24:33.78,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
